This is the client package for pokerth, written in C++/Qt.
Play with bots, or play online with public or private
servers.

Flavour: legacy - only include the old wxWidgets-based client.
This is used by default on architectures where the newer QML-based
client uses too much memory. The legacy client receives bugfixes only,
and carries an internal version number 2.1.9.x, starting with 2.1.9.1.
